# GPU AI MCP Skill

**Server:** gpu-ai  
**URL:** http://api.askcollections.com/mcp/sse  
**Transport:** SSE

## When to use

- Needing GPU or AI-related operations exposed by AskCollections
- Querying or using AI/ML capabilities provided by this MCP
- Tasks that require tools from the gpu-ai server (check available tools in Cursor)

## Usage

Reference this skill with `@mcp-skills/gpu-ai` when the task involves AI or GPU features provided by this server. Verify tool names in Cursor's MCP tool list before calling.

## Notes

- Transport is SSE; ensure Cursor MCP is connected before relying on tools.
- Tool names and parameters are defined by the server—use exact names.
